<title>POLAND: Polish Apator to enter bourse on April 24.</title>
<headline>Polish Apator to enter bourse on April 24.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish gauge maker Apator SA will start trade on the Warsaw stock exchange's parallel market on April 24, the bourse said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It said it would allow for trade in Apator's 1.4 million shares, sold in an oversubscribed initial public offering at 20 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>Apator, based in the central city of Torun, netted 4.8 million zlotys last year on sales of 74.2 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
